"""Typed affine carriers, potentials and descent occurrences of class-A residue rays.

Line `(n+3, n, n+1)`, rays `n = 3 l + r`; every entry is affine in `l`.
Generated by `oracles/python/class_a_descent_table.py --ray d,eps,r` from exact
complete seed graphs; a proof *target*, evidence only through
`psc.class_a_carrier_closure.certify_closure_line` and
`psc.class_a_carrier_descent.certify_descent_line`.
Source note: docs/class-a-residue-rays-2026-10-22.md.
"""


